{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems"]]},"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Systems\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Systems\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/System","doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/SystemSet"],"title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/UpdateEvents","doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/ForwardChanges"],"title":"Built-In Systems","anchor":"Built-In-Systems"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/ForwardEvents","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ForwardEvents","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"E","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"E","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Event","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule5EventP","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Event"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use this system to hand events to code that doesn’t run in a schedule, such as a task that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"plays a sound for each hit. Make a stream, put a ","type":"text"},{"code":"ForwardEvents","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" with the stream’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"continuation in the schedule after the systems that send the events, and iterate the stream","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"elsewhere:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let (damages, continuation) = AsyncStream.makeStream(of: Damage.self)","var world = World()","world.spawn(Position(x: 0, y: -1))","","let frame = Schedule {","    UpdateEvents()","    Combat()","    ForwardEvents(to: continuation).after(Combat.self)","}","frame.run(on: &world)","continuation.finish()","","var amounts: [Int] = []","for await damage in damages {","    amounts.append(damage.amount)","}","print(amounts)","\/\/ Prints \"[10]\""]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each run yields the events the system hasn’t forwarded yet, oldest first, as an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/EventReader","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" reads them. Each "},{"code":"ForwardEvents","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" you create has its own place in the events,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which its copies share. A stream whose consumer has stopped drops what it’s given. The stream"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ends when you finish the continuation, not when the system leaves a schedule."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/systems\/forwardevents"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:7Systems13ForwardEventsV","symbolKind":"struct","modules":[{"name":"Systems"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","title":"ForwardEvents","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ForwardEvents"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ForwardEvents","kind":"identifier"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Systems\/Streams.swift#L37","fileName":"Streams.swift"}},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"A system that yields each event of one type to an asynchronous stream, so code outside the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text